# Bloodbond March: "each player returns all cards with the same name as that spell from their graveyard to the battlefield".
# Bot2 discards both its Dark Confidants to Faithless Looting on turn 2; Looting is no creature spell, so nothing returns.
# On turn 3 Bot1 discards a Dark Confidant and a Llanowar Elves to its own Looting (still nothing returns), then casts
# Dark Confidant: each player's graveyard is searched - Bot1's Confidant returns to Bot1, both of Bot2's return to Bot2
# (all of them, under their owner's control), and the Elves, the Looting cards and the spell itself are untouched.

